WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:04.400
A number line is a line with numbers on it.

2
00:04.400 --> 00:07.600
The numbers are in order.

3
00:07.600 --> 00:11.700
They are the same distance apart.

4
00:11.700 --> 00:14.900
Ivy starts at 8 and hops to 13.

5
00:14.900 --> 00:22.167
She counts 5 hops.

6
00:22.167 --> 00:25.167
13 is 5 hops away from 8.
